---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — ClearBreath"
  description="How ClearBreath handles your data and privacy."
>
  <article class="space-y-10">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <h1 class="text-4xl tracking-tight font-light text-white">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-white/60">Last updated: 2026-02-22</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-white/70">
        ClearBreath is a breathing practice app. This document is provided for
        transparency and accessibility.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-white/70 space-y-2">
        <li>
          Practice data you create in the app (for example, completed breathing
          sessions and preferences).
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">How We Use Information</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-white/70 space-y-2">
        <li>
          To provide and improve core app functionality (for example, showing
          your streak and practice history).
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Data Storage</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-white/70 space-y-2">
        <li>By default, your practice data is stored on your device.</li>
        <li>
          If you choose to sign in, the app may sync selected practice data to
          the ClearBreath backend.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-white/70">
        If you have questions, contact support at:{' '}
        <a
          href="mailto:support@clearbreath.life"
          class="text-white hover:underline"
        >
          support@clearbreath.life
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>

